WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
We thought the distance would bring an answer.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Then we learned that stillness is a kind of arrival.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
The wind will pass. The stories will stay.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Make a little time for the view in front of you.
